<Application
	x:Class="ConsoleGallery.App"
	xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
	xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
	xmlns:md="http://materialdesigninxaml.net/winfx/xaml/themes"
	Startup="OnStartup">
	<Application.Resources>
		<ResourceDictionary>
			<!--
				D-28 (2026-09-23): this used to merge only Tokens.Shared/Styles.Console/Tokens.Light — neither MDIX nor
				MahApps at all. It got away with that because nothing on screen here uses a MahApps or MaterialDesign
				control (no mah:DateTimePicker, no md:PackIcon): the DragHandle/ReorderList/console chrome all come from
				Ironwall.Dotnet.Libraries.Utils's own Themes/Generic.xaml (WPF's default-style resolution for custom
				controls, resolved via the control's own Themes/Generic.xaml regardless of what the Application merges —
				that's the "implicit" catalog the task asked to identify). It still converges on the same shared list as
				the other four tools now, for D-28 consistency and so a future control that DOES need MD/MahApps here
				doesn't silently regress to the phantom-defect state. See tools/shared/HostResources.Pre.xaml/.Post.xaml
				for the line-by-line host mapping; BundledTheme stays local for the same OfType<BundledTheme> reason
				documented there (unused today — console-gallery's own theme toggle below never inspects it — kept for
				parity with the host and the other four tools, and to price the MD engine here truthfully if that changes).

				MainWindow.OnToggleTheme / MatrixWindow.SwapTokens still swap the LAST top-level dictionary in
				Resources.MergedDictionaries by index/name — so an explicit trailing Tokens.Light.xaml entry is kept
				here (Theme.Current.xaml's own nested Tokens.Light is not reachable by that top-level index/name logic).
				Not touched: MainWindow.xaml.cs / MatrixWindow.cs are out of this task's scope (XAML only).
			-->
			<ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
				<ResourceDictionary Source="HostResources.Pre.xaml" />
				<md:BundledTheme BaseTheme="Light" PrimaryColor="Teal" SecondaryColor="Amber" />
				<ResourceDictionary Source="HostResources.Post.xaml" />
				<ResourceDictionary Source="pack://application:,,,/Ironwall.Dotnet.Libraries.Theme;component/Themes/Tokens.Light.xaml" />
			</ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
		</ResourceDictionary>
	</Application.Resources>
</Application>
